{"seq":3,"slug":"migration-consolidation","title":"迁移与整合策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/advanced-patterns/migration-consolidation","wordCount":1236,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"迁移与整合策略\">迁移与整合策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>隔离级别迁移</strong>：将租户从一种隔离模型（Pool/Bridge/Silo）在线迁移到另一种的操作能力</li>\n<li><strong>CDC（Change Data Capture）</strong>：捕获源数据库增量变更用于实时同步的技术</li>\n<li><strong>双写（Dual-Write）</strong>：过渡期内同时写入源和目标两个存储以实现零停机切换</li>\n<li><strong>数据一致性校验</strong>：通过行数、校验和、业务规则、采样四层验证迁移正确性</li>\n<li><strong>补偿回滚</strong>：迁移失败时切回源数据路由并清理目标数据的恢复机制</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"迁移的必然性\">迁移的必然性</h2><p>多租户系统在成长过程中必然面临隔离模型的转换需求：初期为快速起步选择 Pool 模式，签下大客户后需要迁移到 Bridge 或 Silo；或者相反，当租户降级/流失时需要从高成本模式整合到共享模式以优化成本。这些迁移必须在不停机、不丢数据、不影响业务的前提下完成。</p>\n<p>迁移不是一次性事件——它是平台成熟后的常态运营操作。成熟的 SaaS 平台需要将「租户隔离级别迁移」作为一个自动化的、可重复执行的操作能力来建设。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 迁移方向&#10;        POOL[Pool 模式] --&gt;|升级| BRIDGE[Bridge 模式]&#10;        BRIDGE --&gt;|升级| SILO[Silo 模式]&#10;        SILO --&gt;|降级/整合| BRIDGE&#10;        BRIDGE --&gt;|降级/整合| POOL&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 触发场景&#10;        UP1[客户签约 Enterprise] --&gt; POOL&#10;        UP2[合规审计要求隔离] --&gt; BRIDGE&#10;        DOWN1[客户降级/流失] --&gt; SILO&#10;        DOWN2[成本优化整合] --&gt; BRIDGE&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 迁移方向\n        POOL[Pool 模式] --&gt;|升级| BRIDGE[Bridge 模式]\n        BRIDGE --&gt;|升级| SILO[Silo 模式]\n        SILO --&gt;|降级/整合| BRIDGE\n        BRIDGE --&gt;|降级/整合| POOL\n    end\n\n    subgraph 触发场景\n        UP1[客户签约 Enterprise] --&gt; POOL\n        UP2[合规审计要求隔离] --&gt; BRIDGE\n        DOWN1[客户降级/流失] --&gt; SILO\n        DOWN2[成本优化整合] --&gt; BRIDGE\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"pool-bridge-迁移\">Pool → Bridge 迁移</h2><p>将一个租户的数据从共享表迁移到独立 Schema，是最常见的升级路径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"完整迁移流程\">完整迁移流程</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Orch as 迁移编排器&#10;    participant Pool as 源(Pool 共享表)&#10;    participant Bridge as 目标(新 Schema)&#10;    participant App as 应用服务&#10;    participant Router as 路由层&#10;&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;Bridge: 1. 创建目标 Schema + 表结构&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;Pool: 2. 开始 CDC(变更数据捕获)&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;Bridge: 3. 全量数据复制(历史快照)&#10;&#10;    Note over Orch: 4. 增量追赶(CDC 日志回放)&#10;    Pool--&gt;&gt;Bridge: 追赶期间的变更&#10;&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;Orch: 5. 验证数据一致性(行数 + 校验和)&#10;&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;App: 6. 短暂暂停该租户写入(&lt; 5s)&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;Bridge: 7. 最终增量同步&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;Router: 8. 切换路由指向新 Schema&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;App: 9. 恢复写入&#10;&#10;    Orch-&gt;&gt;Pool: 10. 保留源数据 7 天后清理\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Orch as 迁移编排器\n    participant Pool as 源(Pool 共享表)\n    participant Bridge as 目标(新 Schema)\n    participant App as 应用服务\n    participant Router as 路由层\n\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Bridge: 1. 创建目标 Schema + 表结构\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Pool: 2. 开始 CDC(变更数据捕获)\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Bridge: 3. 全量数据复制(历史快照)\n\n    Note over Orch: 4. 增量追赶(CDC 日志回放)\n    Pool--&gt;&gt;Bridge: 追赶期间的变更\n\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Orch: 5. 验证数据一致性(行数 + 校验和)\n\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;App: 6. 短暂暂停该租户写入(&lt; 5s)\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Bridge: 7. 最终增量同步\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Router: 8. 切换路由指向新 Schema\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;App: 9. 恢复写入\n\n    Orch-&gt;&gt;Pool: 10. 保留源数据 7 天后清理</pre><h3 id=\"双写过渡期方案\">双写过渡期方案</h3><p>对于无法容忍短暂暂停的场景，可使用双写（Dual-Write）模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>读源</th>\n<th>写入目标</th>\n<th>持续时间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Phase 0</td>\n<td>Pool</td>\n<td>Pool only</td>\n<td>稳态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Phase 1</td>\n<td>Pool</td>\n<td>Pool + Bridge（双写）</td>\n<td>数据追赶期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Phase 2</td>\n<td>Bridge</td>\n<td>Pool + Bridge（双写）</td>\n<td>验证期（24h）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Phase 3</td>\n<td>Bridge</td>\n<td>Bridge only</td>\n<td>切换完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Phase 4</td>\n<td>Bridge</td>\n<td>Bridge only + 清理 Pool 数据</td>\n<td>最终态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class DualWriteProxy {&#10;  private phase: &#39;pool_primary&#39; | &#39;bridge_primary&#39; | &#39;bridge_only&#39;;&#10;&#10;  async write(tenantId: string, operation: WriteOperation): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;    switch (this.phase) {&#10;      case &#39;pool_primary&#39;:&#10;        await this.poolWriter.write(tenantId, operation);&#10;        // 异步写入 Bridge（允许失败，后续 CDC 补偿）&#10;        this.bridgeWriter.write(tenantId, operation).catch(logError);&#10;        break;&#10;&#10;      case &#39;bridge_primary&#39;:&#10;        await this.bridgeWriter.write(tenantId, operation);&#10;        // Pool 写入降级为可选&#10;        this.poolWriter.write(tenantId, operation).catch(logError);&#10;        break;&#10;&#10;      case &#39;bridge_only&#39;:&#10;        await this.bridgeWriter.write(tenantId, operation);&#10;        break;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DualWriteProxy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> phase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pool_primary'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bridge_primary'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bridge_only'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tenantId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">operation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WriteOperation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.phase) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pool_primary'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.poolWriter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tenantId, operation);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 异步写入 Bridge（允许失败，后续 CDC 补偿）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.bridgeWriter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tenantId, operation).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(logError);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bridge_primary'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.bridgeWriter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tenantId, operation);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // Pool 写入降级为可选</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.poolWriter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tenantId, operation).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(logError);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bridge_only'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.bridgeWriter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tenantId, operation);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"bridge-silo-迁移\">Bridge → Silo 迁移</h2><p>从共享实例中的独立 Schema 迁移到独立数据库实例：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    START[触发迁移] --&gt; PROVISION[1. 创建目标 DB 实例&lt;br/&gt;从模板快照恢复]&#10;    PROVISION --&gt; DUMP[2. pg_dump 源 Schema]&#10;    DUMP --&gt; RESTORE[3. pg_restore 到新实例]&#10;    RESTORE --&gt; CDC[4. 开启 CDC 追赶增量]&#10;    CDC --&gt; VERIFY[5. 数据校验]&#10;    VERIFY --&gt; CUTOVER[6. 切流(更新路由配置)]&#10;    CUTOVER --&gt; CLEANUP[7. 源 Schema 保留后删除]\">graph TD\n    START[触发迁移] --&gt; PROVISION[1. 创建目标 DB 实例&lt;br/&gt;从模板快照恢复]\n    PROVISION --&gt; DUMP[2. pg_dump 源 Schema]\n    DUMP --&gt; RESTORE[3. pg_restore 到新实例]\n    RESTORE --&gt; CDC[4. 开启 CDC 追赶增量]\n    CDC --&gt; VERIFY[5. 数据校验]\n    VERIFY --&gt; CUTOVER[6. 切流(更新路由配置)]\n    CUTOVER --&gt; CLEANUP[7. 源 Schema 保留后删除]</pre><p>关键差异：Bridge→Silo 可以利用 <code>pg_dump --schema</code> 进行整 Schema 的逻辑导出，比 Pool→Bridge 的逐行提取高效得多。对于数据量 &lt; 10GB 的租户，整体迁移可在 10 分钟内完成（含实例创建时间）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"整合-silo-bridge-pool\">整合：Silo/Bridge → Pool</h2><p>当租户降级或批量小租户需要整合到共享实例时：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挑战</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自增 ID 冲突</td>\n<td>迁移时重新分配 ID（UUID 则无此问题）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Schema 差异</td>\n<td>目标 Pool 必须是所有 Schema 的超集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义字段</td>\n<td>映射到 Pool 的 JSONB 扩展列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关联关系维护</td>\n<td>迁移脚本中维护 ID 映射表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迁移后验证</td>\n<td>逐表行数对比 + 业务逻辑校验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 从独立 Schema 合并到共享表&#10;-- 注意：必须添加 tenant_id 列值&#10;INSERT INTO public.orders (tenant_id, customer_name, amount, created_at)&#10;SELECT&#10;  &#39;acme&#39;::UUID as tenant_id,&#10;  customer_name,&#10;  amount,&#10;  created_at&#10;FROM tenant_acme.orders;&#10;&#10;-- 验证迁移完整性&#10;SELECT&#10;  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM tenant_acme.orders) as source_count,&#10;  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM public.orders WHERE tenant_id = &#39;acme&#39;) as target_count;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 从独立 Schema 合并到共享表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 注意：必须添加 tenant_id 列值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">orders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (tenant_id, customer_name, amount, created_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'acme'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::UUID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tenant_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  customer_name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tenant_acme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">orders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 验证迁移完整性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tenant_acme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">orders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">orders</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tenant_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'acme'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target_count;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"数据一致性验证框架\">数据一致性验证框架</h2><p>迁移的最大风险是数据不一致。必须建立多层验证机制：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 验证层次&#10;        L1[行数验证&lt;br/&gt;源 vs 目标每表行数] --&gt; L2[校验和验证&lt;br/&gt;关键列 MD5 聚合]&#10;        L2 --&gt; L3[业务规则验证&lt;br/&gt;余额汇总/关联完整性]&#10;        L3 --&gt; L4[采样验证&lt;br/&gt;随机抽取 1000 行逐字段对比]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    L1 --&gt;|通过| NEXT1[继续下一层]&#10;    L1 --&gt;|失败| ABORT[中止迁移&lt;br/&gt;保持源数据不变]&#10;    L4 --&gt;|全部通过| READY[可以切流]\">graph TD\n    subgraph 验证层次\n        L1[行数验证&lt;br/&gt;源 vs 目标每表行数] --&gt; L2[校验和验证&lt;br/&gt;关键列 MD5 聚合]\n        L2 --&gt; L3[业务规则验证&lt;br/&gt;余额汇总/关联完整性]\n        L3 --&gt; L4[采样验证&lt;br/&gt;随机抽取 1000 行逐字段对比]\n    end\n\n    L1 --&gt;|通过| NEXT1[继续下一层]\n    L1 --&gt;|失败| ABORT[中止迁移&lt;br/&gt;保持源数据不变]\n    L4 --&gt;|全部通过| READY[可以切流]</pre><p>验证 SQL 示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- L1: 行数验证&#10;WITH source AS (&#10;  SELECT COUNT(*) as cnt FROM tenant_acme.orders&#10;), target AS (&#10;  SELECT COUNT(*) as cnt FROM public.orders WHERE tenant_id = &#39;acme&#39;&#10;)&#10;SELECT&#10;  source.cnt = target.cnt as row_count_match,&#10;  source.cnt as source_rows,&#10;  target.cnt as target_rows&#10;FROM source, target;&#10;&#10;-- L2: 校验和验证&#10;WITH source_checksum AS (&#10;  SELECT MD5(STRING_AGG(&#10;    id::text || customer_name || amount::text, &#39;|&#39; ORDER BY id&#10;  )) as checksum FROM tenant_acme.orders&#10;), target_checksum AS (&#10;  SELECT MD5(STRING_AGG(&#10;    id::text || customer_name || amount::text, &#39;|&#39; ORDER BY id&#10;  )) as checksum FROM public.orders WHERE tenant_id = &#39;acme&#39;&#10;)&#10;SELECT source_checksum.checksum = target_checksum.checksum as checksum_match&#10;FROM source_checksum, target_checksum;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- L1: 行数验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cnt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tenant_acme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cnt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">orders</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tenant_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'acme'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cnt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cnt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> row_count_match,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cnt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source_rows,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cnt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target_rows</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- L2: 校验和验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source_checksum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MD5(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">STRING_AGG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'|'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> checksum</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tenant_acme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), target_checksum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MD5(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">STRING_AGG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'|'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> checksum</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">orders</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tenant_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'acme'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> source_checksum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">checksum</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> target_checksum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">checksum</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> checksum_match</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source_checksum, target_checksum;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"在线迁移的工程保障\">在线迁移的工程保障</h2><h3 id=\"回滚策略\">回滚策略</h3><p>每种迁移都必须有明确的回滚路径：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>迁移类型</th>\n<th>回滚操作</th>\n<th>数据保留策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pool → Bridge</td>\n<td>路由切回 Pool，删除目标 Schema</td>\n<td>源数据保留 7 天不删</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bridge → Silo</td>\n<td>路由切回原 Schema</td>\n<td>新实例保留 3 天后释放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Silo → Pool</td>\n<td>路由切回独立实例</td>\n<td>Pool 中的目标数据标记删除</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"迁移状态机\">迁移状态机</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type MigrationState =&#10;  | &#39;pending&#39; // 等待执行&#10;  | &#39;provisioning&#39; // 创建目标资源&#10;  | &#39;copying&#39; // 全量复制&#10;  | &#39;catching_up&#39; // 增量追赶&#10;  | &#39;verifying&#39; // 数据验证&#10;  | &#39;cutting_over&#39; // 切流中&#10;  | &#39;completed&#39; // 迁移完成&#10;  | &#39;rolling_back&#39; // 回滚中&#10;  | &#39;failed&#39;; // 迁移失败&#10;&#10;interface MigrationRecord {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  tenantId: string;&#10;  sourceType: &#39;pool&#39; | &#39;bridge&#39; | &#39;silo&#39;;&#10;  targetType: &#39;pool&#39; | &#39;bridge&#39; | &#39;silo&#39;;&#10;  state: MigrationState;&#10;  startedAt: Date;&#10;  completedAt?: Date;&#10;  metrics: {&#10;    totalRows: number;&#10;    copiedRows: number;&#10;    verifiedRows: number;&#10;    durationSeconds: number;&#10;  };&#10;  checkpoints: Array&lt;{&#10;    state: MigrationState;&#10;    timestamp: Date;&#10;    metadata: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;  }&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MigrationState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 等待执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'provisioning'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 创建目标资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'copying'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 全量复制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'catching_up'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 增量追赶</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'verifying'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 数据验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'cutting_over'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 切流中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'completed'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 迁移完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'rolling_back'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 回滚中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'failed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 迁移失败</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MigrationRecord</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tenantId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  sourceType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pool'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bridge'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'silo'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  targetType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pool'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bridge'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'silo'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MigrationState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  startedAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  completedAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  metrics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    totalRows</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    copiedRows</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    verifiedRows</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    durationSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  checkpoints</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MigrationState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    metadata</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"大规模整合-多租户合并\">大规模整合：多租户合并</h2><p>当需要将数百个小租户从 Bridge 模式整合到 Pool 模式以优化成本时，需要批量编排：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>并发度</th>\n<th>风险控制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>选择候选租户</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>排除活跃度高的租户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批量创建迁移任务</td>\n<td>1（创建）</td>\n<td>验证无冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行执行全量复制</td>\n<td>10 个租户/批</td>\n<td>监控 DB 负载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逐个切流验证</td>\n<td>1 个租户/次</td>\n<td>每个切完验证后再下一个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批量清理源 Schema</td>\n<td>5 个/批</td>\n<td>保留期后执行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    SELECT[选择候选租户&lt;br/&gt;100 个低活跃 Bridge 租户] --&gt; BATCH[分批&lt;br/&gt;每批 10 个]&#10;    BATCH --&gt; B1[批次 1: 全量复制]&#10;    BATCH --&gt; B2[批次 2: 全量复制]&#10;    BATCH --&gt; BN[批次 N: 全量复制]&#10;&#10;    B1 --&gt; VERIFY1[逐个验证 + 切流]&#10;    B2 --&gt; VERIFY2[逐个验证 + 切流]&#10;    BN --&gt; VERIFYN[逐个验证 + 切流]&#10;&#10;    VERIFY1 --&gt; REPORT[整合报告&lt;br/&gt;成功/失败/跳过]&#10;    VERIFY2 --&gt; REPORT&#10;    VERIFYN --&gt; REPORT&#10;&#10;    REPORT --&gt; CLEANUP[源数据批量清理&lt;br/&gt;保留期后]\">graph TD\n    SELECT[选择候选租户&lt;br/&gt;100 个低活跃 Bridge 租户] --&gt; BATCH[分批&lt;br/&gt;每批 10 个]\n    BATCH --&gt; B1[批次 1: 全量复制]\n    BATCH --&gt; B2[批次 2: 全量复制]\n    BATCH --&gt; BN[批次 N: 全量复制]\n\n    B1 --&gt; VERIFY1[逐个验证 + 切流]\n    B2 --&gt; VERIFY2[逐个验证 + 切流]\n    BN --&gt; VERIFYN[逐个验证 + 切流]\n\n    VERIFY1 --&gt; REPORT[整合报告&lt;br/&gt;成功/失败/跳过]\n    VERIFY2 --&gt; REPORT\n    VERIFYN --&gt; REPORT\n\n    REPORT --&gt; CLEANUP[源数据批量清理&lt;br/&gt;保留期后]</pre><h2 id=\"迁移工具选型\">迁移工具选型</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具/技术</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>pg_dump / pg_restore</td>\n<td>Bridge→Silo</td>\n<td>原生、完整、快速</td>\n<td>需要短暂锁定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CDC（Debezium）</td>\n<td>在线迁移所有方向</td>\n<td>零停机、增量同步</td>\n<td>架构复杂度高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逻辑复制（Logical Replication）</td>\n<td>同 PG 版本间迁移</td>\n<td>原生 PG 能力</td>\n<td>不支持 DDL 同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义 ETL</td>\n<td>跨数据库类型迁移</td>\n<td>完全可控</td>\n<td>开发维护成本高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AWS DMS</td>\n<td>云环境迁移</td>\n<td>托管服务、多源支持</td>\n<td>有延迟、部分功能限制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>隔离模型间的迁移是多租户平台的常态运营能力而非一次性项目。Pool→Bridge 升级最常见，通过 CDC + 双写实现零停机；Bridge→Silo 可利用 pg_dump 整 Schema 导出快速完成；反向整合需解决 ID 冲突和 Schema 差异。所有迁移必须建立四层数据一致性验证（行数→校验和→业务规则→采样）和明确的回滚路径。大规模整合时采用分批并行 + 逐个切流验证的编排策略，控制风险在单个租户粒度。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"tenant-customization-extensibility\">租户定制化与可扩展性</a> 讨论了在迁移过程中如何处理租户级定制数据的兼容性问题。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"迁移与整合策略","id":"迁移与整合策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移的必然性","id":"迁移的必然性"},{"level":2,"text":"Pool → Bridge 迁移","id":"pool-bridge-迁移"},{"level":3,"text":"完整迁移流程","id":"完整迁移流程"},{"level":3,"text":"双写过渡期方案","id":"双写过渡期方案"},{"level":2,"text":"Bridge → Silo 迁移","id":"bridge-silo-迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"整合：Silo/Bridge → Pool","id":"整合-silo-bridge-pool"},{"level":2,"text":"数据一致性验证框架","id":"数据一致性验证框架"},{"level":2,"text":"在线迁移的工程保障","id":"在线迁移的工程保障"},{"level":3,"text":"回滚策略","id":"回滚策略"},{"level":3,"text":"迁移状态机","id":"迁移状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"大规模整合：多租户合并","id":"大规模整合-多租户合并"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移工具选型","id":"迁移工具选型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"租户定制化与可扩展性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/multi-tenancy-patterns/advanced-patterns/tenant-customization-extensibility"},"next":null}